     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I accidentally pressed something in RStudio, because now the only run button for my R script window is the Shiny Run App button.<div><br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-ZFlG5_ZxT_0/U-AGnV1WawI/AAAAAAAACjk/nPbLh6ww1_g/s1600/Screen+Shot+2014-08-04+at+3.17.17+PM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-ZFlG5_ZxT_0/U-AGnV1WawI/AAAAAAAACjk/nPbLh6ww1_g/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2014-08-04%2Bat%2B3.17.17%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792402638441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34sdxCvY_onFrVP_yD6Ihy\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-ZFlG5_ZxT_0/U-AGnV1WawI/AAAAAAAACjk/nPbLh6ww1_g/s320/Screen+Shot+2014-08-04+at+3.17.17+PM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"109\"></a></p><div>I want to get back just the default run buttons.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-4rwLrMXEagc/U-AGyN8CFmI/AAAAAAAACjs/H1_xP2QOrSk/s1600/Screen+Shot+2014-08-04+at+3.18.21+PM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-4rwLrMXEagc/U-AGyN8CFmI/AAAAAAAACjs/H1_xP2QOrSk/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2014-08-04%2Bat%2B3.18.21%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792402638441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22tInhGMLdlUwaQ6SQjcWk\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-4rwLrMXEagc/U-AGyN8CFmI/AAAAAAAACjs/H1_xP2QOrSk/s320/Screen+Shot+2014-08-04+at+3.18.21+PM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"131\"></a></p><div>Does anyone know how to do this?</div></div></div>"
    ]
